                <li className="[-webkit-box-sizing:border-box] [-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased] [font-size:.9em] [line-height:1.5] [font-weight:400]"><strong className="[font-weight:bolder] [-webkit-box-sizing:border-box] [-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased]">Predictive Analytics:</strong> Forecasting demand, market trends, and customer behavior.</li>
