                <p className="wp-block-paragraph [margin-top:0] [margin-bottom:1rem] [-webkit-box-sizing:border-box] [-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased] [font-weight:400]">Gartner predicts that by 2026, <strong className="[font-weight:bolder] [-webkit-box-sizing:border-box] [-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased]">more than 70% of organizations will operationalize AI in at least one critical business function</strong>, making it a core driver of competitiveness.</p>
